Step 12: END
Cannot use y uniquely while a unique reference to y exists


Rust does not compile:
error[E0507]: cannot move out of `*w` which is behind a mutable reference
 --> test_code.rs:7:13
  |
7 |             *w;
  |             ^^ move occurs because `*w` has type `&mut u32`, which does not implement the `Copy` trait

